 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nMumbai Engineering Works Pvt                    MASTER SERVICES\nLtd                                                     AGREEMENT\n22 MG Road, 600001 Chennai, India\nGSTIN: 97AAACG1933A1Z6\n\nFROM                                               BILL TO\n\nMumbai Engineering Works Pvt Ltd                  Bharat Components Pvt Ltd\n22 MG Road                                        Plot 14, MIDC Industrial Area\n600001 Chennai                                    560001 Bengaluru\nIndia                                             India\nVAT: 97AAACG1933A1Z6\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 24-03-2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Mumbai Engineering Works Pvt Ltd, with its registered office at 22 MG Road,\nChennai (\"Party A\"), and Bharat Components Pvt Ltd, with its registered office at Plot 14, MIDC\nIndustrial Area, Bengaluru (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n Party A  Mumbai Engineering Works Pvt Ltd / Rahul Verma\n Party B  Bharat Components Pvt Ltd / Priya Sharma\n Date     24-03-2026",
